    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d324">

                <pb facs="0658" n="564" sameAs="frus:frus1945Malta/pg564"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">J. C. S. Files</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Joint Chiefs of Staff to
                        the First Deputy Chief of General Staff of the Soviet Army</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Antonov</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Yalta</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-02-03">3 February 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for General Antonov
                    </hi>
                </p>
                <p>It is the desire of the American Staff to discuss with the Soviet Staff details
                    of possible participation in the war against Japan. Can you obtain approval of
                    this suggestion?</p>
            </div>
        </body>
